      "text": "Expand @trait-multi-ref-batch to remaining commands: trait add/remove, task set --automation, inbox delete, task note. Enables batch operations like 'kspec task note @ref1 @ref2 @ref3 \"shared content\"'. Consolidated from @01KG71J2, @01KG95JM, @01KFVXBM.",
