    },
    {
      "ref": "01KHA982",
      "text": "Formalize CLI usage analysis as a repeatable workflow. Tools exist in .claude-research/tools/ (parse-ralph-logs.mjs, parse-claude-logs.mjs, compile-data.mjs) plus interactive HTML report. Consider: kspec skill, CLI command, or standalone workflow. Re-run after implementing the 6 CLI agent-UX improvements to measure impact.",
      "created_at": "2026-02-13T01:18:34.385Z",
      "tags": [],
      "added_by": "@claude",
      "triaged": true,
      "triage_action": "defer"
    },
    {
      "ref": "01KHCYW7",
      "text": "Add repeated-flag support to --status filter (ac-repeated-flag gap from PR #354). Commander.js .option() needs a collect function to accumulate repeated --status flags into an array. Currently only comma-separated works. Small fix: change .option('-s, --status <status>') to use Commander's variadic/collect pattern, then feed array into parseMultiStatus().",
      "created_at": "2026-02-14T02:15:03.519Z",
      "tags": [
        "cli",
        "dx",
        "reflection"
      ],
      "added_by": "@claude",
